      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Just a guess, and I can't prove any of it, but I think Jensen leaving is only the opening act of a partisan fight. Democrats take both chambers in January, so the hearings and investigations could get a lot worse. My read is that Nvidia's board wants to keep his personal political baggage away from the company's future. Him resigning won't make the scrutiny go away, but I doubt a petition is going to change the board's math either.\n\nAre you worried Tesla or SpaceX could get hit with the same kind of political pressure next year?"
