            "id": "2121291797473468421",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Jensen drove supply chain brilliantly at Nvidia, but many of those deals were a handshake with Jensen, not a written contract. \n\nWithout Jensen, at least some of those critical deals will be lost. https://t.co/2CH1QNPG8x"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "44196397",
        "conversation_id": "2121613402846204253",
