        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2121613402846204253",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "If Jensen gave me his word about compute delivery or I asked for components to be accelerated, he always came through. \n\nSure, we’d put together a purchase order at some point later, but I never for a second thought it wouldn’t happen."
      },
